# Implementation Plan - Navigation, 50m Alerts & Database Persistence

This updated plan incorporates your feedback: English voice alerts, 50-meter proximity distance, and persistent data storage.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Choice**: I am proposing **SQLite (sqflite)** for the database. This will store the potholes locally on your phone so they persist even after you close the app. If you need a **shared** database (where all users see the same potholes), please let me know, as that would require Firebase or Supabase.

> [!NOTE]
> **Alert Distance**: The proximity alert is now set to **50 meters**. This provides more reaction time for drivers.

