### Proximity Alerts System (English, 50m)

#### [MODIFY] [main.dart](file:///c:/ssdd/flutter/lib/main.dart)
* **Initialize TTS**: Setup `FlutterTts` to use "en-US".
* **Distance Logic**: 
    * Increase `alertDistance` to `50.0`.
    * Use `Geolocator.getPositionStream` to monitor distance to all database-loaded potholes.
    * Trigger voice: "Warning: Pothole 50 meters ahead."

